{"parse": {"title": "微尘", "pageid": 2189, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"微尘\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a2/CurrencyItem-205.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"微尘\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>微尘</b><img alt=\"CurrencyIcon-205 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/CurrencyIcon-205_1.png/24px-CurrencyIcon-205_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/CurrencyIcon-205_1.png/36px-CurrencyIcon-205_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/CurrencyIcon-205_1.png/48px-CurrencyIcon-205_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>2#5</div></div><hr /><div>来自于至高音律的余振。可用于提升角色的等级。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">辉煌的至高律无迹可寻，它的力量伟大而不可估计。徘徊时抖落的微尘亦蕴藏着引发提升的能量。从某种意义上来说，这粉尘便是终极答案的其中一角。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">资源·尘埃运动</td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">迷途鉴定</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "微尘"}}